## ✅ Security Hardening Notes

| Risk | Mitigation |
|------|------------|
| Unauthorized file access | Session-based access control |
| Directory traversal | Using `Path` and `secure_filename` |
| File overwriting | Prefix with UUID first 8 chars |
| Concurrent uploads | `UPLOAD_QUEUE` per session prevents overlap |
| Missing confirmation | Finalized only after user confirms |
| Session fixation | Use `$FLASK_SECRET_KEY` and avoid reusing sessions |

