### 🛡️ Пример реализации через аспект (AOP — Spring + AspectJ):

```java
@Aspect
@Component
public class SecurityAspect {

    @Pointcut("@annotation(com.security.annotations.SecureAccess)")
    public void secureMethods() {}

    @Around("secureMethods()")
    public Object checkSecurity(ProceedingJoinPoint pjp, SecureAccess sec) throws Throwable {
        Authentication auth = SecurityContextHolder.getContext().getAuthentication();
        if (!auth.isAuthenticated()) {
            throw new SecurityException("User not authenticated for restricted operation.");
        }

        List<String> userRoles = auth.getAuthorities().stream()
            .map(GrantedAuthority::getAuthority)
            .toList();

        if (sec.requiredRoles().length > 0 &&
            !Arrays.stream(sec.requiredRoles()).anyMatch(userRoles::contains)) {
            throw new SecurityException("Insufficient role to access secured method.");
        }

        // Аудит: запись в журнал
        if (sec.auditEnabled()) {
            log.info("Secure access granted: {} - {}", pjp.getSignature(), auth.getName());
        }

        return pjp.proceed();
    }
}
```

