### 步骤 3：使用 Socket 传输（Spring Boot 中启动 TCP Server）

```java
@Component
public class VideoSocketServer implements DisposableBean {

    private volatile boolean running = false;
    private final ExecutorService executorService = Executors.newCachedThreadPool();
    private final ImageToH264Stream encoder = new ImageToH264Stream();

    @PostConstruct
    public void start() {
        running = true;
        executorService.submit(() -> {
            try (ServerSocket serverSocket = new ServerSocket(8080)) {
                System.out.println("视频服务器启动，监听端口 8080...");

                while (running) {
                    Socket clientSocket = serverSocket.accept();
                    System.out.println("客户端连接: " + clientSocket.getInetAddress());
                    executorService.submit(new ClientHandler(clientSocket));
                }
            } catch (IOException e) {
                if (running) {
                    e.printStackTrace();
                }
            }
        });
    }

    private class ClientHandler implements Runnable {
        private final Socket socket;

        public ClientHandler(Socket socket) {
            this.socket = socket;
        }

        @Override
        public void run() {
            try (OutputStream out = socket.getOutputStream()) {
                // 模拟持续发送图片帧（如每秒 25 帧）
                while (running) {
                    BufferedImage image = loadSampleImage(); // 从摄像头/文件加载
                    byte[] h264Frame = encoder.imageToH264(image);

                    // 发送帧长度 + 帧数据（防粘包）
                    out.write(intToBytes(h264Frame.length));
                    out.write(h264Frame);
                    out.flush();

                    Thread.sleep(40); // ~25 FPS
                }
            } catch (Exception e) {
                e.printStackTrace();
            }
        }
    }

    private BufferedImage loadSampleImage() {
        try {
            return ImageIO.read(new File("sample.jpg"));
        } catch (Exception e) {
            return new BufferedImage(640, 480, BufferedImage.TYPE_INT_RGB);
        }
    }

    private byte[] intToBytes(int value) {
        return new byte[]{
            (byte) (value >> 24),
            (byte) (value >> 16),
            (byte) (value >> 8),
            (byte) value
        };
    }

    @Override
    public void destroy() {
        running = false;
    }
}
```

> ✅ 说明：
> - 使用 `intToBytes` 发送帧长度头，实现 TCP 分包处理。
> - 客户端需按“长度 + 数据”格式解析 H.264 帧。
> - 支持多客户端连接（通过线程池）。

