|------|----------|
| `pivote` typo | ✅ Corrected to `pivotIndex` |
| Random pivot logic | ✅ Now uses `Random` safely and moves pivot to end |
| Poor small-array handling | ✅ Added `THRESHOLD = 10`, uses insertion sort |
| `compute()` returns `Void` not `Integer` | ✅ Corrected to `Void` since nothing to return |
| Left task forked, right computed — better load balance | ✅ Yes |
| Array sharing — safe because disjoint ranges | ✅ Safe because recursive partitioning ensures non-overlapping |
| Thread-local randomness | ✅ `Random` is fine locally (no need `ThreadLocalRandom` for this small scope) |

