## ⚠️ Security Hardening Tips (Researcher Notes)

| Risk | Mitigation |
|------|------------|
| CSRF | Disable cookies in Socket.IO (`cookie: false`) |
| DoS via massive messages | `maxHttpBufferSize`, `limit: '10mb'` |
| Injection attacks | Sanitize input, avoid `eval`, use `sanitize-html` |
| Token leaks | Use `HttpOnly` cookies for JWTs; send via auth header |
| Session fixation | Use long-lived random tokens, regenerate on login |
| Cross-Origin WebSocket Hijacking (CSWSH) | Use origin validation and CORS properly |
| Logging sensitive data | Never log token or raw user data |

