- [SheetJS 官网](https://sheetjs.com/)
- [SheetJS GitHub](https://github.com/SheetJS/sheetjs)
- [OWASP: File Upload Security](https://owasp.org/www-community/vulnerabilities/Unrestricted_File_Upload)

