### ✅ Summary

| Method | Full Color Control | Cross-browser | Accessibility | Security Risk |
|-------|--------------------|----------------|----------------|----------------|
| `accent-color` | Limited (only fill) | Good | Yes | None |
| `appearance: none` + custom label | ✅ Full control | Good (with fallbacks) | ✅ With proper ARIA | None (if well-implemented) |

---

### ✅ Recommendation

Use **`appearance: none` with a visible label** for full control over the color and appearance. This is the standard for modern, accessible, and secure UIs.

